{
    "title": "CashWalk - Daily pedometer app",
    "description": "Are you looking for a motivational pedometer to help you stay fit and improve your health?\r\nCashWalk can be an excellent choice for all ages.\r\nWe automatically track every step for your health, and even get paid for it!\r\n\r\n\u2b50FEATURES of CASHWALK\u2b50\r\n\u00b7 100% FREE pedometer app that calculates consumed calories, distance traveled, and time every time you turn on your smartphone.\r\n\u00b7 Earn coins simply by installing the pedometer and walking. (Up to 20,000 steps per day!)\r\n\u00b7 Coins can be used to redeem gift cards from famous brands.\r\n\u00b7 Utilizing the latest technology, it consumes minimal battery per hour.\r\n\r\n1) Step Counter\r\n\u00b7 Utilize features of step trackers for free\r\n\u00b7 No GPS tracking to save your battery\r\n\u00b7 Automatically works for indoor & outdoor activities like walking , running, walking the dog, and other exercises!\r\n\r\n2) Activity Trends\r\n\u00b7 Calculate your walking distance\r\n\u00b7 Counts daily, weekly, and monthly steps, as well as the calories you've burned\r\n\u00b7 Useful for aiming for weight loss or improving health\r\n\u00b7 Designed specifically to help track step data.\r\n\r\n3) Rewards\r\n\u00b7 Cashwalk provides beneficial rewards to motivate walking\r\n\u00b7 Get coins for every step, up to a maximum of 20000 steps\r\n\u00b7 Redeem gift cards\r\n\r\n4) Community\r\n\u00b7 Participate in the \u2018Steps Challenge\u2019 opened in the community and get rewarded upon achievement\r\n\u00b7 Share your health and fitness tips with CashWalkers in our fitness community\r\n\r\n\u231aSync your steps\r\n\u00b7 Open the app and go to the menu on the top left\r\n\u00b7 Click Wearable Device tab and turn on the Toggle button\r\n\u00b7 Allow permissions and start walking!\r\n\u00b7 Make sure to turn on the lockscreen on mobile Cashwalk app to collect coins from the wearable device.\r\n\u00b7 Set tiles on the wearable device and check your steps easily!\r\n\r\nDownload this pedometer, the best step counter app.\r\nAnd the best weight lose app.\r\nCashWalk will run in the background, wasting no battery, to count your steps as a distance tracker and pacer.\r\nIt's the easiest way to reach your health and fitness goals by walking every day.\r\nGet health and gift cards by taking steps with this easy pedometer app!\r\n\r\n\u2757Attention\r\n\u00b7 This pedometer is exclusive to Android and iOS. Please do not use a VPN or Emulator then your account may be suspended.\r\n\u00b7 The use of some devices that do not meet specifications and standards may be restricted.\r\n\u00b7 This pedometer, step counter is an app designed to improve your health and fitness.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you looking for a motivational pedometer to help you stay fit and improve your health?<br>CashWalk can be an excellent choice for all ages.<br>We automatically track every step for your health, and even get paid for it!<br><br>\u2b50FEATURES of CASHWALK\u2b50<br>\u00b7 100% FREE pedometer app that calculates consumed calories, distance traveled, and time every time you turn on your smartphone.<br>\u00b7 Earn coins simply by installing the pedometer and walking. (Up to 20,000 steps per day!)<br>\u00b7 Coins can be used to redeem gift cards from famous brands.<br>\u00b7 Utilizing the latest technology, it consumes minimal battery per hour.<br><br>1) Step Counter<br>\u00b7 Utilize features of step trackers for free<br>\u00b7 No GPS tracking to save your battery<br>\u00b7 Automatically works for indoor &amp; outdoor activities like walking , running, walking the dog, and other exercises!<br><br>2) Activity Trends<br>\u00b7 Calculate your walking distance<br>\u00b7 Counts daily, weekly, and monthly steps, as well as the calories you&#39;ve burned<br>\u00b7 Useful for aiming for weight loss or improving health<br>\u00b7 Designed specifically to help track step data.<br><br>3) Rewards<br>\u00b7 Cashwalk provides beneficial rewards to motivate walking<br>\u00b7 Get coins for every step, up to a maximum of 20000 steps<br>\u00b7 Redeem gift cards<br><br>4) Community<br>\u00b7 Participate in the \u2018Steps Challenge\u2019 opened in the community and get rewarded upon achievement<br>\u00b7 Share your health and fitness tips with CashWalkers in our fitness community<br><br>\u231aSync your steps<br>\u00b7 Open the app and go to the menu on the top left<br>\u00b7 Click Wearable Device tab and turn on the Toggle button<br>\u00b7 Allow permissions and start walking!<br>\u00b7 Make sure to turn on the lockscreen on mobile Cashwalk app to collect coins from the wearable device.<br>\u00b7 Set tiles on the wearable device and check your steps easily!<br><br>Download this pedometer, the best step counter app.<br>And the best weight lose app.<br>CashWalk will run in the background, wasting no battery, to count your steps as a distance tracker and pacer.<br>It&#39;s the easiest way to reach your health and fitness goals by walking every day.<br>Get health and gift cards by taking steps with this easy pedometer app!<br><br>\u2757Attention<br>\u00b7 This pedometer is exclusive to Android and iOS. Please do not use a VPN or Emulator then your account may be suspended.<br>\u00b7 The use of some devices that do not meet specifications and standards may be restricted.<br>\u00b7 This pedometer, step counter is an app designed to improve your health and fitness.",
